WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
You're doing great. Just a little further to go.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A few things to keep in mind tonight.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
If you haven't had a bowel movement yet after starting your prep, don't panic.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
It can take a couple of hours to kick in.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Keep drinking your clear liquids and stay patient.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Also, continue to avoid all solid foods and alcohol.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
And if you're on a split-dose prep, your second dose is coming up.

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
There's a separate video walking you through that.

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Lastly, before you go to sleep, confirm your arrival time with your driver for tomorrow.

10
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.480
You're doing everything right. Get some rest and we'll see you soon.
